X:1
T:Badinerie
C:Johann Sebastian Bach
O:Orchestral Suite No. 2 in B minor, BWV 1067, 7th movement
N:Flute part, transposed down from Bach's B minor to F minor so it fits the recorder
N:(C4 to Ab5). Notes, barring and ornaments from the flutetunes.com score and MIDI;
N:pitches cross-checked against the norbeck.nu ABC setting, which agrees except that
N:it writes the mordents in bars 7-10 and 29-32 out as sixteenths.
N:The appoggiaturas in bars 33 and 40 are written out as eighths.
N:Chords read from the four lower voices of the flutetunes.com quartet arrangement.
M:2/4
Q:1/4=120
L:1/16
